# The parent C# repository ignores .meta and Packages contents globally.
# Unity needs asset GUIDs and its resolved package manifests in source control.
!**/*.meta
!/Packages/
!/Packages/manifest.json
!/Packages/packages-lock.json
!/ProjectSettings/Packages/
!/ProjectSettings/Packages/**/
!/ProjectSettings/Packages/**/*.json

# BEGIN unity vcs doctor
# Unity ignore rules kept current by `unity vcs doctor --fix`. Managed block: edits here are overwritten. To opt out of a rule, negate it below this block (for example `!*.log`).
*.aab
*.apk
*.app
*.blend1
*.booproj
*.mdb
*.svd
*.unitypackage
